  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Outlander Claw",
    "summary": "Your **GENESTEALER CULTS MOUNTED** and **GENESTEALER CULTS VEHICLE** models that are not **[Battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)** get +1 OC.\n\nAs [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) ends, if any of your **ATALAN JACKALS** units are in range of an [objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives) under your control, it stays under your control until a phase ends with your [Level of Control](vsdata:core-rule/level-of-control) over it lower than your opponent's.",
